<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24427" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inter-rādo</span></b> , rāsi,
			rāsum, 3, v. a. (al. most exclusively
		in Pliny and Columella). <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i>to scrape here and
				there</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">interrasa cortice,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Paul. Nol. Carm. 27, 254</span></i>
			. — </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			
			 Esp., <i>to emboss</i> or <i>work in low relief</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">latera vasorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					33, 11, 49, § 140</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>To prune here and there</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">oleae interradi gaudent,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					15, 1, 2, § 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">olivetum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					17, 18, 30, § 130</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">arbores,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					Arb. 19</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
